Subject: [PATCH 16/31] [Test] dcp: Cover PP prefill stages feeding a DCP4
 decode

Each PP stage relays its own layer range onto the unpipelined decode's
79 entries, and the stage's DSA index-K state slices from its first
layer. The non-final chunk wait-event case is added with its fix.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
